{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:30.474Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"※この記事は執筆中ですので今後内容が変わる可能性があります。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"いろいろな記事を読んで、やってみて、一番うまくいった例を紹介します。難しい言葉が多いので初心者は wiki とかを見てください。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1 ターン目（６０年代）の攻略"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1 ターン目（６０年代）の攻略"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p8","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"開幕した瞬間から販売終了するまで TU104 をできるだけ買い"},{"_key":"p9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"、707-120 をできるだけリースする。必要であればクレジットを換金するのもあり。\nそして、707F を 1 機購入し、超近距離の大都市路線を作り、貨物クエスト２つを 1 ターン目でクリア。余裕があれば追加購入する\n（例　ロンドン～パリ、ニューヨーク～ボストン　など）\nTU104 が生産終了したら、需要の高い（大都市間の独占路線）路線を 737,727 に置き換え。そして、収入が増えたら DC-8-62 と 707 を中心に買います。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pc","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pb","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"707 はリースのみで、買い直す必要はありません。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pj","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pd","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"リースした 707 は、"},{"_key":"pe","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"会社の価値にはならず"},{"_key":"pf","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"、"},{"_key":"pg","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"不利"},{"_key":"ph","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"になるので、"},{"_key":"pi","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"75 年くらいになったらリースは全て売却します。なお、今後リースは一切使わないでください。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pl","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pk","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1971"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pr","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pm","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"この前買った"},{"_key":"pn","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"TU104 は全て売却"},{"_key":"po","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"します。ここからは"},{"_key":"pp","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"長距離・貨物メイン"},{"_key":"pq","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"に切り替えます。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p19","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"ps","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ここからは"},{"_key":"pt","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"７０００キロ以上の路線が儲かります"},{"_key":"pu","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"。DC-8 系は座席数が少ないので小さい規模の路線に移動し、東京〜ロンドン規模の路線に 747-100、"},{"_key":"pv","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"繁忙期の純利益が５０万を超えて"},{"_key":"pw","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"いれば東京〜ニューヨークのような"},{"_key":"px","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"超長距離路線もここで開拓"},{"_key":"py","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"します。"},{"_key":"pz","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"たまに廃課金勢がいる"},{"_key":"p10","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"のでそういう時は"},{"_key":"p11","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"諦めます"},{"_key":"p12","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"。"},{"_key":"p13","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"諦めないでその人の次"},{"_key":"p14","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"を目指します。"},{"_key":"p15","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"1971 年には DC-10-30F が発売"},{"_key":"p16","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"します。"},{"_key":"p17","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"最強クラスの機体"},{"_key":"p18","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"なので１ターンで 10〜20 機のペースで買います。なぜそんなに急ぐかというと、1972 年から経済状況が悪化し、収入が半分くらいに減るからです。それでも資金に余裕があるなら IL-62M を購入し、今後に備えた路線開設を行います。価値と満足度が低いので多くても 30 機程度にしておきます。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1b","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"1972"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p1i","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1c","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"経済危機が発生して、収益が減ります。ここは最初の難関です。弱い会社"},{"_key":"p1d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"はここで潰れます。"},{"_key":"p1e","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"基本的にうまくいけば赤字になることはなく"},{"_key":"p1f","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"、月１５万以上は儲かっているはずです。ちなみにここでいう赤字というのは、"},{"_key":"p1g","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"減価償却費が総収益を上回っている"},{"_key":"p1h","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ということです。　もしあなたが赤字でも他のプレイヤーはもっと酷いので、きっと放置するだけで順位が上がっていくでしょう。余裕があれば月１機のペースで DC-10-30F を買います。経済レベルが落ちているので儲かりませんが、逆に言えばここが路線開拓のチャンスです。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1k","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1j","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1973"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p1t","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1l","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"7 月には"},{"_key":"p1m","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"経済危機が終了"},{"_key":"p1n","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"し、１０月には"},{"_key":"p1o","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"L-1011-500 が発売"},{"_key":"p1p","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"されます。収益も増え、敵もまた、稼ぎ始めるので、"},{"_key":"p1q","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"ここでいかに差をつけるかが重要"},{"_key":"p1r","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"です。危機が開けたらすぐさまに１ターン 10~20 機のペースで"},{"_key":"p1s","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"L-1011-500 と DC-10-30F を買います。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1v","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1u","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"L-1011 は中小都市から大都市または中都市へ、経由便を使用して路線開設します。IL62M で開拓した路線が 100%になったらそれも置き換えます。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1x","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1w","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"L-1011 で 747 用の大規模路線を確保しておき、747 が登場したら置き換えるという手もありです。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1z","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1y","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1974"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p2f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p20","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"DC-8 の満足度が下がってきたはずなので、"},{"_key":"p21","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"DC8-62 は IL-62M"},{"_key":"p22","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"に、"},{"_key":"p23","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"61 は DC-10 か、大きすぎるのであれば余った機材でやりくり"},{"_key":"p24","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"しましょう。（競合していなければそのまま壊れるまで使っても問題ないです。）DC8-から"},{"_key":"p25","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"IL-62M"},{"_key":"p26","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"にする理由としては、"},{"_key":"p27","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"資金をこれだけに割くことができない"},{"_key":"p28","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"からです。それでも"},{"_key":"p29","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"１路線 4000 ほど儲けられるのには変わりはない"},{"_key":"p2a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ので、できるだけ"},{"_key":"p2b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"安いもの"},{"_key":"p2c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"にして、"},{"_key":"p2d","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"減価償却を抑えます"},{"_key":"p2e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2h","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2g","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"離脱した DC8 たちは、売却するか、もし空いているのであれば新規路線を開拓します。あまり売りすぎると、会社の価値が下がるので注意。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2j","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2i","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1975~1980"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p2w","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2k","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"この辺で"},{"_key":"p2l","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"400~500 路線"},{"_key":"p2m","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ほどになっているのがベストです。このタイミングで買った方がいい機材は、"},{"_key":"p2n","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"747-200、DC-10-30、L-1011-500、IL-62M"},{"_key":"p2o","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"です。小型機に関しては、寿命がきたりしない限りは、"},{"_key":"p2p","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"改装するだけ"},{"_key":"p2q","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"にしておきます。これ以降はロンドン~フランクフルトのような"},{"_key":"p2r","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"大規模路線が見つからない限り"},{"_key":"p2s","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"、短距離路線を開設するのは"},{"_key":"p2t","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"やめましょう"},{"_key":"p2u","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"。"},{"_key":"p2v","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"スロット取得に時間がかかるからです。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p33","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2x","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"長距離"},{"_key":"p2y","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - IL62M, L-1011-500 / 747-200\n"},{"_key":"p2z","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"中距離"},{"_key":"p30","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - 747-100 / DC-10-30 / L-1011-500\n"},{"_key":"p31","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"短距離"},{"_key":"p32","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - MD-81 / DC-10-30 / 747-100"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3b","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p34","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"置き換えについてです。DC-8-61 と DC-8-62 がそろそろ古くなってくるので、"},{"_key":"p35","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"残り 50 週間"},{"_key":"p36","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"を目安に置き換えを始めます。"},{"_key":"p37","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"１ターン５機ずつ"},{"_key":"p38","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"くらいです。"},{"_key":"p39","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"早め早めに手を打っておかないと、墜落する"},{"_key":"p3a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ので要注意。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3h","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"貨物に関しては、"},{"_key":"p3d","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"搭乗率１００%の 707 を、DC10-30 に置き換え"},{"_key":"p3e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"て、残り"},{"_key":"p3f","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"は新規路線開設"},{"_key":"p3g","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"に回します。そうでないところは、DC-8-70F に置き換えます。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3p","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3i","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1980 年 5 月からは、"},{"_key":"p3j","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"原油価格が上昇する"},{"_key":"p3k","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ので、ここでも"},{"_key":"p3l","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"順位"},{"_key":"p3m","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"を"},{"_key":"p3n","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"大幅に上げる"},{"_key":"p3o","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ことができます。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3r","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3q","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1980~1985"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p3t","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3s","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"L-1011 が約 100 機程度になったら、買うのはやめ、767-200 の登場を待ちます。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3v","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3u","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"この時代の理想の航空機リストです。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3x","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3w","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"747-100 は古くなっているので、747-200 を短距離用に改装し、747-300 を長距離用に回します。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p44","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3y","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"長距離"},{"_key":"p3z","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - IL62M, L-1011→767 / 747-100→747-300\n"},{"_key":"p40","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"中距離"},{"_key":"p41","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - L-1011→767 / DC-10-30\n"},{"_key":"p42","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"短距離"},{"_key":"p43","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - MD-81 / DC-10-30 / 747-200"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p46","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p45","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"参考"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p49","_type":"link_card","description":"エアタイクーンオンライン2は全世界のプレイヤーと対戦し世界中に航空網を作り、利益をあげてゆくオンライン型の航空会社経営シミュレーションゲームです。","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:15:51.249Z","id":"https://ato2jp.wiki.fc2.com/","metadataUrl":"https://ato2jp.wiki.fc2.com/","siteName":"ato2jp.wiki.fc2.com","title":"エアタイクーンオンライン2wiki","unavailable":false},{"_key":"p4c","_type":"link_card","description":"航空会社経営ゲームの『エアタイクーンオンライン2 』。 課金無しでもやり方次第で上位に入る事ができて、中々やり","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:23.612Z","id":"https://torihikolife.com/air-tycoon-online2-tips","image":"../../media/1be40cf0bca5d01f109e6c1da7656cc6383c4e664abcf76392918897932d9ae7.jpg","metadataUrl":"https://torihikolife.com/air-tycoon-online2-tips","siteName":"とりひこライフ","title":"【エアタイクーンオンライン2 】攻略！無課金でもTOP3常連になれる経営方法 | とりひこライフ","unavailable":false},{"_key":"p4f","_type":"link_card","description":"要点 1960年の早い時期のチャンネルに参入する、場合によっては今あるチャンネルへの参入を控えるのも手 最初の拠点は北米か欧州がいいのではないか 投資は最大限に 1960年代は1ターン1時間 1963年11月まで、ひたすらTU-104を買い揃えていく 路線開設はメッシュ型で TU-104の生産終了後から、高需要路線の機体をB707-120やDC-8-11に置き換える B727-100QFがリリースさ...","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:19.251Z","id":"https://rapidliner-tips.tumblr.com/post/120598553870/ato2-1960","metadataUrl":"https://rapidliner-tips.tumblr.com/post/120598553870/ato2-1960","siteName":"Tumblr","title":"【ATO2】新規参入～1960年代の経営","unavailable":false},{"_key":"p4i","_type":"link_card","description":"長い文章ですが、このポイントに従えば会社はあっという間におおきくなります！ 航路開設の基本 まず、航路は基本的に 独占航路のみ開設 していきます。 特に序盤は、これを徹底していきましょう。ライバルに構うだけ、お金の無駄です。もし ライバルが競合してきた場合は、さっさと撤退...","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:15:48.759Z","id":"http://simgametips.blogspot.com/2017/02/blog-post_15.html","metadataUrl":"http://simgametips.blogspot.com/2017/02/blog-post_15.html","siteName":"simgametips.blogspot.com","title":"ATO2 航路開設の際の注意点やポイント","unavailable":false},{"_key":"p4l","_type":"link_card","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:15:48.012Z","id":"https://air-tycoon-online.fandom.com/wiki/Aircraft","metadataUrl":"https://air-tycoon-online.fandom.com/wiki/Aircraft","siteName":"air-tycoon-online.fandom.com","title":"air-tycoon-online.fandom.com","unavailable":true},{"_key":"p4o","_type":"link_card","description":"������˵��ܤ��빶ά�ϡ��桼�����γ����󤬤��줾��˹ͤ����ȼ��ι�άˡ�Ǥ��Τǡ������ι�άˡ��100���������Ȥϸ����ޤ��󡣤����ޤǻ������٤��ɤ�褦�ˤ��Ƥ����������кѴ����ι������������Ǻ�...","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:20.254Z","id":"https://seesaawiki.jp/airtycoononline/d/%A5%D7%A5%EC%A5%A4%A5%E4%A1%BC%A4%CE%B9%B6%CE%AC","image":"../../media/831559550243ab38462215e712872560ce1c554342813d15a3183c4ea8010380.png","metadataUrl":"https://seesaawiki.jp/airtycoononline/d/%A5%D7%A5%EC%A5%A4%A5%E4%A1%BC%A4%CE%B9%B6%CE%AC","siteName":"�������������󥪥�饤�� ����wiki","title":"�ץ쥤�䡼�ι�ά - �������������󥪥�饤�� ����wiki","unavailable":false},{"_key":"p4r","_type":"link_card","description":"�Ҷ���ҷбĥ��ߥ�֥������������󥪥�饤��2�פι�ά�ȥץ졼�����Ǥ����ܤ��ܤ������档","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:15:48.541Z","id":"http://ato2game.jugem.jp/?eid=4","image":"../../media/bf7c585729c8548e2e4a047df400015510d4d89f2c0991557e55296d20f5d9b3.png","metadataUrl":"http://ato2game.jugem.jp/?eid=4","siteName":"�������������󥪥�饤��2��ά�֥���","title":"M&A | �������������󥪥�饤��2��ά�֥���","unavailable":false},{"_key":"p4t","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4s","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":": )"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"","emoji":"🤖","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":false,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2021-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","title":"エアタイクーンオンライン２クレジットガチ稼ぎ虎の巻","translation":null},"id":"01M3TQXTFAE3MAHE6JYCQ4W0P5","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2021-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"ato2-best-practice","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9G5JJ1PDJ66DQC1SMT71","label":"ノート","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"notes","translationGroup":"01M40J9FWGZJ4QGPXX3EY0703C"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9SKHPEY1K08QRDQMCMXA","label":"game","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"game","translationGroup":"01M40J9SBQCEFXQY27A691P4RJ"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3TQXTFAE3MAHE6JYCQ4W0P5"}
